00:31:43,096 --> 00:31:43,336
Tamam.

233
00:31:44,336 --> 00:31:46,515
Tabii, bir saniye.

234
00:31:47,556 --> 00:31:49,435
Şey, bir saniye.

235
00:31:53,683 --> 00:31:55,223
